{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0194oULFASZtt6Z65aab7MPw","type":"tool_result","content":"README.md\nscripts/deploy.sh\nsrc/assets/logo.png\nsrc/assets/mark.svg\nsrc/booking.js\nsrc/clases.html\nsrc/index.html\nsrc/styles.css\n# ruta-ceramica site\n\nStatic site for a ceramics studio: plain HTML, one CSS file, one JS file\n(the class booking widget). Hosted on S3 behind CloudFront.\n\n- `src/` — the site as served (no build step; `scripts/deploy.sh` copies it up)\n- `scripts/deploy.sh` — upload to the bucket and invalidate CloudFront\n\nDeploy: `./scripts/deploy.sh` (needs AWS CLI configured with the studio profile).\n\nKnown problem: after a deploy, returning visitors keep running the old\n`booking.js` for days. The CloudFront invalidation runs every time, but\nbrowsers never ask again, because the objects are uploaded with no\n`Cache-Control` header at all.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c7a078f1-a7d1-492b-8f89-799105179931","uuid":"bb06b77b-c77a-4293-96ea-f80f9c0b876d","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:37:26.840Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"README.md\nscripts/deploy.sh\nsrc/assets/logo.png\nsrc/assets/mark.svg\nsrc/booking.js\nsrc/clases.html\nsrc/index.html\nsrc/styles.css\n# ruta-ceramica site\n\nStatic site for a ceramics studio: plain HTML, one CSS file, one JS file\n(the class booking widget). Hosted on S3 behind CloudFront.\n\n- `src/` — the site as served (no build step; `scripts/deploy.sh` copies it up)\n- `scripts/deploy.sh` — upload to the bucket and invalidate CloudFront\n\nDeploy: `./scripts/deploy.sh` (needs AWS CLI configured with the studio profile).\n\nKnown problem: after a deploy, returning visitors keep running the old\n`booking.js` for days. The CloudFront invalidation runs every time, but\nbrowsers never ask again, because the objects are uploaded with no\n`Cache-Control` header at all.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta