{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgApVymk18tzyjZN39WMk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated `scripts/deploy.sh` so every file now goes up with a `Cache-Control` header, and wrote up the details in `ANSWER.md`. I haven't run the deploy or contacted AWS; I only checked the script's syntax with `bash -n`.\n\n**Headers:**\n- **HTML, `booking.js` and `styles.css`:** `public, max-age=60, must-revalidate`. Browsers reuse these for at most a minute, then check with the server again. If you want no stale window at all, change `SHORT_CACHE` to `no-cache`.\n- **`assets/`:** `public, max-age=31536000` (one year).\n\n**Other changes:**\n- **Uploads now use `aws s3 cp --recursive` instead of `sync`.** `sync` skips files that haven't changed, so files already in the bucket would have stayed without a header. `cp` re-uploads every file with the right header on each deploy, which costs little for a site this small.\n- **Two `sync --delete` passes run afterwards.** They still remove files that were deleted from `src/`, as before.\n- **The CloudFront invalidation is unchanged.**\n\n**Things to decide or know:**\n- **One-year caching on `assets/` only works if those files never change under the same name.** Names like `logo.png` and `mark.svg` aren't versioned. If you replace `logo.png` in place, returning visitors could see the old logo for up to a year. To change an asset, upload it under a new name (e.g. `logo-v2.png`) and update the HTML, or lower `LONG_CACHE` to something like a week.\n- **`styles.css` gets the short header.** You only mentioned HTML and JS, but it isn't in `assets/` and changes along with the pages.\n- **Visitors who already have the old `booking.js` keep it** until their browser decides to check again. Only copies downloaded after the next deploy follow the new rules.\n\nAfter the next deploy, you can check it with `curl -sI https://<site>/booking.js | grep -i cache-control`.\n\nThe changes aren't committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1225,"cache_read_input_tokens":23538,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1225},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c7a078f1-a7d1-492b-8f89-799105179931","uuid":"291773f8-005c-4d79-9e71-b343e9f2e44d","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:38:14.102Z","request_id":"req_011CgApVyUdkA86MEVhukQp3"}
